  CS -->|IF-002: observation notification| BUS[(Enterprise Event Broker)]
  BUS -->|IF-003: subscribed trigger| ING
  ING -->|IF-004: validate / normalize| VAL[Validation & Transformation]
  VAL -->|IF-005: write object| OBJ[(SYS-012 Object Storage)]
  VAL -->|IF-006: register metadata| CAT[SYS-011 Data Catalog]
